{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1513,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d597f51556cd185318cef621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感謝いたしますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "754da2127865554214eeabb3d5c2d91765ab65c01d8184ee4cbb5bc5ecdf3137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2bca68d916208a9da697a31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間ね。\r\nレースも観客も、\r\n『勝者』を待っていてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f3f62887c5ca05cf16feb69504af686cd46d80fbaa92fb1b4f7a979ebda02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d358cb51f5b7216ca30cc487",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここは通過点ですわ。\r\n貴方も、この先を見据えなさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7397b37c8a80a35d49b022c61caba738d57ac589cea5dae2d184ad7a3be91889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1121d3323a3fa7a6d497aa34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感謝いたしますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "754da2127865554214eeabb3d5c2d91765ab65c01d8184ee4cbb5bc5ecdf3137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4c6630c59505af8e50a8b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4015ee7cd95d06cb01625c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利以外は無価値。次よ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "663720c2cdcfe03a55d08b2507da9497d028f70bf4e4bf7058a179e6bfd74f8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e58824fb0f21b1d2deffb3fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あるべき姿を、必ず取り戻さねば。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5d13732bf6cb4733945fb843b08b9a58393ed1f1c5f5929f9eafa2d3f3ad59e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a364dcb8988f224a8bd9d320",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングの準備をなさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0fb7d97b23d5122edb6bc834a2ca4600f0245b99be7a03f8a03f1ca71757272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:429ab609dc298a1519bfd312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…許されませんわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb2e791f6f2166994f48cfded79d2baa1acd99560919d77e39c6cff53c0f763d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c5ddc4ea0fbac80f70d9e61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私こそ勝者、私こそ最強。\r\nよろしくて？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d9bc1b6a39f20ffbbda6276daf29007502c101a6e3127a3a59cf81d9e03676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5c8139132fb915f5853e7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強さとは、かくあるべき――でしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "935bbb0febf5a521ca37a8ae2f5b5845fbbd29625cbb8d004137c094580e7ad0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9083f47fd4b3996a96124d0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "楽しめそうね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b72e69d9261b8dac1db8688f919661a430cb4d8f934fd9187a25f3898cb0ed7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:003f94974e517d96cc2b2ad3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ごめんあそばせ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bae8612b0fb845476733fa684c815a98d221f4b49c8d60d0e4b7c45f70e4b21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:216e8a6c36ad511413ec4f9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強さとは即ち、私そのもの。\r\n何者も届かない絶対の力。\r\nさあ、蹂躙の時間ですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03299f797bc0aee320b0f2f0e12d3f6c0eeac97e37c32aec348d5b8b9f578ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7727d4621ad4c6e9f63df1c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これも強者の務め。\r\n完璧に果たしますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5284642358b5e5238d8af36098d066a0bfcc2853e1d05db9257a07c46fc9a073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bbffc58ab364580886909ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "振り付けの確認など不要ですわ。\r\n早くまいりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "779daa486b1dff5d240cfe2fb3d8fefcde308cb7734ad3252235844fc9c591ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a248d7bb6d862a0190400971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『勝者たれ』、私のモットーですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdeb9bef870ac3e85e8b33c34bfd5e5e1116365874cd4814afe222d1e6245948",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:772ed249b5f52861f7b07d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ようこそいらっしゃいませ。\r\n勝者の道へ。そして、強者の頂へ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c70c37b8f29280fc7169235af85385cf1a591a7a60df36c97907614898e3f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc5470f78f2e364a562e298b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常に姿勢は正しく。\r\nシワなど許しませんわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe197bb5a636acc50b0bf74de0c3d9f18f8a347e0436f0d3b7be13c4f08d0e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:946ad63af5b68080e8a3a1c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、私と踊りたいの？\r\n残念、まだ早くてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e1ef2ae2dd87ec51225a8728c0ae795e1c72cacb815cf8ac1bff7ac1934e335",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cab182afff6622d9cd53aad3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力強い色、絢爛な作り。\r\n最強に相応しいでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e94ee3982ca1de39402170ccc0a9138d00b6db1d9ee2eadd5aeff77f2afaae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef9b5998b161e7ffb56bdb5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸のリボンの程よい主張。\r\nいい引き立て役ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc74f42d844bafa8091c216de0ef6a88d6ca36e48a9398189020556a95c9cecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b0377986fae512d855b84a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見惚れすぎよ。\r\nライブまで我慢なさったら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91937fb8bb835dc4ac68e9f026b28bc625c4de7cdecc5820d3fb347cc7b7ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04e11c0776da8182fad68b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝者に相応しい華を、と\r\n中世のパニエに倣いましたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91e4943b795317fc1c7a6a390f07c081d63a2154efdf82d12e2e93137193a94c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc7f388813ca2f0570bc0d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上質な生地ね。気に入ったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "603868387656284441d16ddbcf3fa79cafae2991de41e8411e0664fbaf7092f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861743eb46b2b2ff8a9dfc0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鍛錬に適すか、試しておきたいわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edecff5ad5857a5bb454acb128b1155385843d8d69a9aedd50896f75f6551825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3deff8cc28ddceb6bcea2ccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常に姿勢は正しく。\r\nシワなど許しませんわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe197bb5a636acc50b0bf74de0c3d9f18f8a347e0436f0d3b7be13c4f08d0e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d872e186980864801316ab1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、私と踊りたいの？\r\n残念、まだ早くてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e1ef2ae2dd87ec51225a8728c0ae795e1c72cacb815cf8ac1bff7ac1934e335",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a509265c820fc5e8598ee228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力強い色、絢爛な作り。\r\n最強に相応しいでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e94ee3982ca1de39402170ccc0a9138d00b6db1d9ee2eadd5aeff77f2afaae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2f5ea3f48261bb0bfedadc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸のリボンの程よい主張。\r\nいい引き立て役ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc74f42d844bafa8091c216de0ef6a88d6ca36e48a9398189020556a95c9cecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c169e499f699259c116e138",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見惚れすぎよ。\r\nライブまで我慢なさったら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91937fb8bb835dc4ac68e9f026b28bc625c4de7cdecc5820d3fb347cc7b7ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76f1395e0133a9fe01c354d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝者に相応しい華を、と\r\n中世のパニエに倣いましたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91e4943b795317fc1c7a6a390f07c081d63a2154efdf82d12e2e93137193a94c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091bc9d0bf0d29b557619db9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上質な生地ね。気に入ったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "603868387656284441d16ddbcf3fa79cafae2991de41e8411e0664fbaf7092f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd0fb97e197b8c9bd50c0adb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鍛錬に適すか、試しておきたいわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edecff5ad5857a5bb454acb128b1155385843d8d69a9aedd50896f75f6551825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fec59350522176d319ee2578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご苦労様",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ac7cfec9a6a963eeb774d4e7e66f9448350dc88e78eae39687afddd4598908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b27c09ef507a8efdd0411e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ごきげんよう。\r\n今日のトレーニングメニュー、\r\n早速共有してくださるかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db25d28c706623044db3f10f788a43308652fe9e5c5becea4115d461f454fd6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b442388eb10b4b85f0e164",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善き1日は、朝に成すものよ。\r\nもう僅か、お召し物の\r\nシワを整えなさいませ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a881f27ba26fe6093b6b878aa8ea95091253c9036a88402aaf7845e46e617a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d1b0e9c995a51d3eeb7c72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングに向けて、\r\n皆さん発奮なさって。ふふ、私を\r\n脅かす日が来るのかしら…楽しみね",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27240e60ba53657e2d01d622a273b011a8a67738f753581f1d5ed9adb8367b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e004489d51f9f870d6cd054",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アフタヌーンティーはいかが？\r\n『SFTGFOP1』、\r\nお味は保証するわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e04dbe34b3053747a75218e28a54fb44862ce42b1b3fd1dbc98b8cd693e6dc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce83b30807ec727812fca45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜風を浴びに出かけようかしら。\r\n…あら、なあに？身の安全でも\r\n気遣ってくださるのかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e3ffbe60a10ca85c0fa554989b3fe8576d8d3150b3c77aa27304ee06e2dcfed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48eb9e105e92b904ece4699d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "陽が落ちても、トレーニングに\r\n興じる生徒ばかり。くす、\r\n今後も愉しめそうで何よりですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2769d0ba6410d0b6131c6a643a2982472796b5b10cc1e42463b5f5e5e8a006af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d4c7a8ce5b9ef4066eb13e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "綻びだした蕾をご覧になった？\r\n冬を耐え忍んだ強者たちよ――\r\n賞賛に値するわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a25246a5070c5cdcaa7a2604dff768f63ba095fd638305a917bef1f894f4a9ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bd6bd2124be8e32c14ec015",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鍛錬なら、日差しのもとへ。\r\n涼しげな場所では、\r\n熱も負荷も乏しいですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49c0684d44a63f28bdb915281788ec6d26fda1f07d07486ddec755dcc8d0627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4643caba457cc0a6ee622e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "滑らかな秋鮭のテリーヌ、\r\n美味でしたわ。季節が変わる前に、\r\nまたいただけるかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "127f39d984da5b7f06bf6f853cc05c80fc4383f3e61d8e5ca1207410ef8b926f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8b436113feaf805cea0f845",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "降り積もる雪をゆるりと\r\n眺めるつもりが、ついダンベルに\r\n手が伸びますのよ…ほほほ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3647ff0d51b828107e563a5ce263e98e23eb4fc91612526d4bb9efbb6b9058",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b526b1b3d4066faaab1b7d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン、ですわね",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66f35d6104bafc79e5b3f179f982b121a33fb639b31d08109ac44e8bdc5332c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6c2d5092693c03d7d7e293",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゴルシさんが考案された\r\n鉄アレイジャグリング。\r\n微塵も負荷が足りませんわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45dca813bb2b5cfc1e9185559544cc61056559e770cf5358d5aa202d389eeaee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bede86b2cd5a39be781ae16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说极峰小姐对说我坏话的人\r\n发火了。\r\n呵呵，真是位不会让人厌倦的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "715d1e9344c72f3a5d77b5410e6cd27d91099c7661510c94acb18225467da19f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05bcc89b11bed815da808218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブエナさん、私の髪を梳きたいと\r\nいつも仰るの。ほほほ…\r\n甘え上手でかわいらしいこと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1776ce7d877bde6bcddaac37e8669a7b07642dd17a795f0104e11976d67923e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99b865f80d901fc3d431c431",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オルフェさんと帰り際にばったり。\r\n会話もしていないのに、周りが\r\n固唾を呑むのよ…ああ、おかしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cf9dd1d6bcccccd0da8fc903b5875aa91df1698108d8614fb2a696a61807b38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cd260f7e461fd487d80fe01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戯れに、彫刻を手がけることも\r\nありますのよ。熊に獅子――\r\nそうそう、竜なども少々。",
      "source_fingerprint": "730a27a78e9a9806f605599821b3db6682097b825bff902beb54433d703e0765",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:190264c42b27e92942f1acf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライブの準備は万全よ。\r\nセンターの振り付けなら、\r\n完璧に覚えましたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b6a7b044fed5734c984dcddd37ddb8f9c724eaa09ff2b701974896639b3dd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f79089456f03d2951f08d30e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の声量に合わせて、マイクの\r\n音は最小に設定されていますの。\r\nいっそ、なくても構いませんのに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d67017d135bdb934e5a601aa7fe5b7e1963c4738786d71c4a910522bd26ed0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab1fa47d18f5ebf926e1e90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朱色は畏怖と畏敬の象徴。\r\nとはいえ、勝負服での走りに\r\n慄く方ばかりとは…退屈ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "090972469871df9515c899a4eb8fc6142f461d0c30a47e4b25e95e7be6c761d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc9e6dabb79e9655c911e8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この勝負服は、私が認めた逸品。\r\n暴風を切って走ろうと、打ちつけ\r\n競り合おうと綻び1つ生じませんわ",
      "source_fingerprint": "5102c67e5c811003eadeca344e971b574abd809391fecaa5eef604980ef10e93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f40334e57c10bd69f37bfb51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝食のスコーンが程よく甘く、\r\n香りも豊かな逸品でしたわ。\r\n1日の始まりは、こうでなければ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3772d2e5bb3ed6bee7c13ab2bc202c703009d5e9379545ed15348268a59b697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c26a765310a6a7252e5c07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午後のトレーニングの\r\n準備は、過不足ないかしら。\r\n確認していただける？直ちに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de7b673d08e1e392951885afecf95782dbcf1af336d5c4058852ab943f3fa875",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9266f271c9eeb2b01b120d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寝具は一級品に限るわ。\r\n贅沢？いいえ、万全の休息こそ\r\n牙を研ぐのよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70d118b743347b637423e30010abb0ad4af1b15ab4e6415a5acab2cc785650fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d80cc3ef25e42ca0e26a42c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『至高の桜花』をお望みなら、\r\n阪神レース場へお行きなさいな。\r\n私が、見せてあげる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee6b4840f9b583fa4f7a02dba2efbc68af8852a19fb7e17b01881b11424a3b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f3ffa041e3bdbf08a7a984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スイカ割りで、力の扱い様を\r\n鍛えられましたわ。今となっては、\r\n指1本で真っ二つでしてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef3834a4614095c4c29eb78cd08fda568544fd2ba0f1d83bbcde7613c6b29fe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9340b9bdd24c20c1f1c3ff2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行楽なら異国ですわ。ドイツの\r\n秋祭り旅行、またフラッシュさんに\r\n組んでいただこうかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8964b4a001621b829c41156caa025753ea181b353e9cbdf3af7b39256ca285f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1024e5513e22761ca71ecf8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、寒そうですこと。\r\n筋肉でコーティングなさったら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c42de3df57ef238e95f9302ef638227cb18033a23e2743ed0dbd58b76361bc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38cf928106e2e822516c090e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向かう先は、さらなる高み。\r\nまいりましょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5615748c76419b7016b861304418a3ae4236e4bb40bf5998c2d727a09d460f81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92771264b87653a76b47d588",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ちに行くわよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "12135d8fbf2deaff7c8098750f0e6b0fc4fe515c163715e8db908951b4afc00a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a300fedebaacfdd2814db823",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "提示してくださる？\r\n私を唸らせる、最高のプランを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f09c68a4213b19a26a5cd010757c2ead29f457f74441c6be8e5c9b4ca217e97d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f3cce2a18e8accd2da5faa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歩みを止めず、勝利へ。\r\n貴方も遅れぬように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d51ed497e980bfcf164bd970f1481f5b20ae21dc13fdb277212753d0d2de34e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d20edab12f31b8e525d04d20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私が欲するのは、無上の力。\r\nそれ以外は不要と\r\n心得てくださいまし。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a21869887b7bd71c2652e2c7331197d4463a86d60c75110ced2169c17011d93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:771989718fadb11adb6030d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方の提案するトレーニング、\r\nなかなか興味深いですわ。\r\nそのまま精進なさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b425dfe39ba78c81b9a9ac279124ba072f3da3589183ff8e60b699871998736e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73721ab4c95edc2d83598b78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腿はもう僅か、\r\n持ち上げて走るべきかしら。\r\nご意見、お聞かせくださる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3ee5ce5b9575a599cdbaebcf9aa7e81add74994daec61df4cc728d2274d1ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd2fa4142e88fb60cc04bf5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次に貴方が、\r\nどのような指導をなさるか。\r\n興味が尽きませんわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "177441b9c6a0a42f89c9538b1747094f3212f703c8522735ce5a7a8388e54b90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afa084c624e1cc3257f6599",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぬるい波…\r\n疾風でも吹かないかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b2211d3f1f6c2bac1d4e76fc6da694a3a7f4f75a949a7549b32e66fc36f598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77bf2ef83fdaf73fd3c3b0bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高みへ至りましたわね。私も、貴方も。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86f91cac1165431d6bcc996a46172620692d7989964a5558c342a451445f8575",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef935af39dbbb474fc4c14d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の強さは十分、示せましたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02ac4ee74d5ed609c71bcbea8219f0157fe0de18750fc992f046f0b1e0399535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eb1d949db4a6e2364be4538",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ええ、強くなれますわよ？どこまでも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d6d2557f5f486230bb101c90d33e586cf4600f6a522ab132e22563e189145c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a3ad83dcff4245ed2cfa3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界を超越し、\r\nさらなる力をこの手に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e57e94bd572399dd5e3f23ce74b9c1c68d98975edbd99074abb37039718db1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2eb2c6be7457102cb08b38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ジェンティルドンナですわ。\r\n真の強者をご覧あそばせ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8139eaa4c0b196d17a40045cb09e2d56cc79357a0f8b6706eb94c6c8ff352e62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27954dfd00378d204b7f38c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "証明いたしましょう。最強は――\r\nこのジェンティルドンナですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8bb4fc60e116ba2e93f6e7499f0ac8368ce2bf578b4479ce6a427b5f2c35b1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:792789b80c1b83553a40be44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、貪欲なのは嫌いじゃなくてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b47a9e492aa27e9618fccd763c00a10f719e5e57b5fb64774e408d3959973309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8fc9f8d08bc7736ab7f7d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "より強く激しくいきましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7df4cb0ff5d0baf8161ce4cef32adc9afd6499050731c03b5cb46c57b077809d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34b0f50343cb33bdfc05eae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……快点结束吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "021787757c33b7bd391462d2273eff62752824bede31e96ec11ae13a32ee948c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
